# ==========================================
# Database
# smartreco.db and chroma_db/ are committed on purpose (pre-seeded catalog +
# embeddings, credentials already stripped via strip_user_credentials.py).
# Only stray WAL/SHM journal files are ignored, never the main .db files.
# ==========================================
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Dev/debug scripts — not part of the app
check_events.py
test_api.py
test_env.py

requirements.txt.bak

# Not for the public repo
PROJECT.md
CLAUDE.md

# Database
smartreco.db
smartreco.db-wal
smartreco.db-shm

# NOTE: chroma_db/chroma.sqlite3 is intentionally NOT ignored —
# it holds product embeddings/catalog metadata only (no PII),
# and must stay committed to avoid re-generating embeddings.